* @title Word-length filter over input text
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix D, Solution 2.3
* @input >>>
* 5
* THE QUICK BROWN FOX JUMPS.
* SIXTY SEVEN EIGHT NINE?
* <<<
* @expect >>>
*  WORDS OF LENGTH 5 ARE:
* QUICK
* BROWN
* JUMPS
* SIXTY
* SEVEN
* EIGHT
* <<<
          &TRIM = 1
          WORD = BREAK(' ,.;?') . W LEN(1)
          N = INPUT
          OUTPUT = ' WORDS OF LENGTH ' N ' ARE:'
READ      TEXT = INPUT ' ' :F(END)
NEXTW     TEXT WORD = :F(READ)
          OUTPUT = EQ(SIZE(W),N) W :(NEXTW)
END
